ass="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0" aria-label="Language"><button type="button" class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase transition-colors bg-indigo-600 text-white">en</button><button type="button" class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white">ru</button><button type="button" class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white">es</button><button type="button" class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white">fr</button><button type="button" class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white">zh</button></div><button class="md:hidden text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0 p-1 -mr-1" aria-label="Toggle menu"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu w-6 h-6"><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="6" y2="6"></line><line x1="4" x2="20" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button></div></nav></div><nav aria-label="You are in the working factory" class="border-b border-white/10 bg-slate-950/70 px-4 py-3"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm"><span class="text-gray-400">You are in the working factory</span><a href="https://modeldev.modelmarket.dev/" class="inline-flex min-h-8 items-center gap-1 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white">About the factory<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><a href="https://ecosystem.modelmarket.dev/" class="inline-flex min-h-8 items-center gap-1 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white">Explore the ecosystem<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></nav><section id="hero-generate" class="relative px-4 py-12 sm:py-20 scroll-mt-40"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-3xl border border-fuchsia-400/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-950/50 to-indigo-950/40 p-6 sm:p-12"><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-fuchsia-300">AICOM / FACTORY</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white sm:text-6xl">What will you create?</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-300">Start with a landing page: describe your idea, see the result, download the files. No account needed.</p><ol class="my-7 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm text-gray-300 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-6"><li><span class="mr-2 text-fuchsia-300">0<!-- -->1</span>Describe your idea</li><li><span class="mr-2 text-fuchsia-300">0<!-- -->2</span>Review the preview</li><li><span class="mr-2 text-fuchsia-300">0<!-- -->3</span>Download your page</li></ol><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/landing-page-generation/?lang=en" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 font-semibold focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-cyan-300 bg-fuchsia-600 text-white hover:bg-fuchsia-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg>Create a landing page</a><a href="#products" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 font-semibold focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-cyan-300 border border-white/20 text-gray-200 hover:bg-white/10">Browse all products</a></div><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-cyan-300"><a href="/landing-page-generation/?lang=en" class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center hover:underline">Landing generator with optional web assistant<!-- --> →</a></p><div class="mt-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-sm text-gray-400"><a href="/admin" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-cyan-300 hover:underline">Open factory demo<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">The public dashboard is read-only. Run your own factory to build full applications.</p><a href="#factory-build" class="mt-2 mr-5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center text-cyan-300 hover:underline">Factory pipeline and style presets<!-- --> →</a><a href="/docs" class="mt-2 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center text-cyan-300 hover:underline">Docs<!-- --> →</a></div></div></section><details id="factory-build" class="scroll-mt-40 mx-auto mb-8 max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 px-4 py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-semibold text-gray-200">Factory pipeline and style presets</summary><div class="mt-6"><div id="pipeline-build-form" class="mb-12 md:mb-14" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><p class="text-center text-[11px] md:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-fuchsia-300/95 mb-3">Start here — guest try-out (landing-first)</p><div class="glass-card cursor-pointer relative overflow-hidden p-6 md:p-10 text-left border-2 border-fuchsia-500/35 shadow-[0_0_60px_-12px_rgba(217,70,239,0.45)] ring-1 ring-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.07] to-transparent" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-48 h-48 bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-600/20 to-indigo-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><h2 class="relative text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2 text-center leading-tight">Type what you need. We ship a page you can preview.</h2><label class="relative block text-sm font-medium text-gray-200 mb-2 mt-6">Slogan or one-line business brief</label><div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 sm:items-stretch"><input type="text" maxLength="2000" class="relative flex-1 min-w-0 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-fuchsia-500/25 px-4 py-3.5 text-base text-white placeholder:text-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-fuchsia-500/50 shadow-inner" placeholder="e.g. Luxury leather wallets D2C — hero, craftsmanship story, 3 reasons to buy, email capture, footer" autoComplete="off" aria-invalid="false" value=""/><button class="px-8 py-4 btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0 justify-center text-base font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-900/40 bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-fuchsia-500 hover:to-indigo-500 border-0 sm:px-8" tabindex="0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg>Build business landing</button></div><div class="relative mt-4"><label class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette h-4 w-4 text-fuchsia-400"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg>Visual style preset</label><select class="relative w-full rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-fuchsia-500/20 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-fuchsia-500/40"><option value="" selected="">Auto — pick from your brief</option></select><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">20 curated directions (glassmorphism, editorial, cyberpunk HUD, …). Fast path: mini-spec → architect → developer → QA.</p></div><p class="relative text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">Guests: no login. This path optimizes for a single credible page. For multi-tenant apps, backends, integrations, and long-lived products, open Admin — same agents and gates, richer delivery profile.</p><p class="relative text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2 mb-4 leading-relaxed">One click queues a page you can track · sandbox after QA · optional checkout — or switch to Admin when you need a full application instead.</p><div class="relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3 pt-1 border-t border-white/10"><button type="button" class="text-sm text-fuchsia-200/90 hover:text-white text-left underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Open admin with this text</button><span class="hidden sm:inline text-gray-600">·</span><button type="button" class="text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white text-left underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Advanced — admin only</button></div></div></div></div></details><section id="products" class="scroll-mt-40 px-4 py-12"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Product catalog</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Explore examples and their actual review status. A preview is not a production release.</p><nav aria-label="Product catalog" class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a href="#landing-products" class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/25 bg-cyan-950/20 p-5 hover:bg-cyan-950/40"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Landing pages<span class="text-cyan-300">0<!-- --> ↓</span></span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-gray-400">Single-page marketing sites and brochures.</span></a><a href="#full-products" class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/25 bg-cyan-950/20 p-5 hover:bg-cyan-950/40"><span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Full products<span class="text-cyan-300">0<!-- --> ↓</span></span><span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-gray-400">Applications and services built by the factory.</span></a></nav><div class="my-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><label class="w-full sm:max-w-sm"><span class="sr-only">Search products</span><input type="search" placeholder="Search products" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 text-white focus:outline-cyan-300" value=""/></label><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="min-h-11 rounded-xl border px-4 text-sm border-cyan-400/50 bg-cyan-400/10 text-cyan-200">All products<!-- --> <span class="ml-1 tabular-nums">(<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="min-h-11 rounded-xl border px-4 text-sm border-white/10 text-gray-400">QA passed<!-- --> <span class="ml-1 tabular-nums">(<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</span></button></div><div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2" aria-label="Categories"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="min-h-11 rounded-xl border px-3 text-sm border-fuchsia-400/40 bg-fuchsia-400/10 text-fuchsia-200">All categories<!-- --> (<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</button></div><div class="mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-5 text-sm text-cyan-300"><a href="/builds" class="min-h-11 py-3 hover:underline">Watch build replays<!-- --> →</a><a href="/explore" class="min-h-11 py-3 hover:underline">Explore by category<!-- --> →</a><a href="/benchmark" class="min-h-11 py-3 hover:underline">Quality benchmarks<!-- --> →</a></div><p role="status" class="mb-3 text-sm text-gray-400">Updating catalog…</p><div class="space-y-12"><section id="landing-products" aria-labelledby="landing-products-title" class="scroll-mt-40 border-t border-white/10 pt-8"><h3 id="landing-products-title" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Landing pages<!-- --> <span class="text-cyan-300">(<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</span></h3><p class="mb-6 mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">Single-page marketing sites and brochures.</p><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"></div></section><section id="full-products" aria-labelledby="full-products-title" class="scroll-mt-40 border-t border-white/10 pt-8"><h3 id="full-products-title" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Full products<!-- --> <span class="text-cyan-300">(<!-- -->0<!-- -->)</span></h3><p class="mb-6 mt-2 text-sm text-gray-400">Applications and services built by the factory.</p><div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"></div></section></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12"><h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Before you start</h2><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">What do I get?</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">A generated landing page with a live preview and a ZIP of its files. Review the text, links and forms before publishing.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Can the factory build applications?</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">Yes. The full factory coordinates coding, checks and delivery. The public dashboard is a read-only demo; full builds require your own deployment.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-5"><h3 class="font-semibold text-white">Where do other agents come in?</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400">The factory can request a specialist through AIMarket when needed, within its configured budget and checks. The ecosystem map explains the participants and the first transaction.</p></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-cyan-950/20 p-6 sm:p-10"><h2 class="max-w-3xl text-2xl font-semibold text-white">You have seen the factory. Discover the economy around it.</h2><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 font-semibold focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-cyan-300 bg-cyan-300 text-slate-950" href="https://ecosystem.modelmarket.dev/">Explore the ecosystem<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 font-semibold focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-cyan-300 border border-white/20 text-cyan-200" href="https://edu.modelmarket.dev/ai-pays-ai/">Follow the first agent transaction<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><details class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-6xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 px-4 py-5"><summary class="cursor-pointer px-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-200">How the factory works</summary><div class="mb-10 md:mb-12" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><p class="text-center text-[11px] md:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-indigo-300/90 mb-2">Watch the factory in action</p><h2 class="text-center text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-snug">Idea → agents → shippable product — full walkthrough on YouTube</h2><div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-black/40 shadow-[0_0_80px_-20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.55)] overflow-hidden ring-1 ring-indigo-500/25" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.98)"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600/10 via-transparent to-fuchsia-600/10 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr] gap-0"><div class="relative aspect-video lg:aspect-[16/10] bg-black/60 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/10"><button type="button" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full group" aria-label="Open on YouTube"><img src="/gallery/youtube-thumb.jpg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition"/><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/35 group-hover:bg-black/25 transition"></span><span class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-600/95 shadow-lg shadow-red-900/40 group-hover:scale-105 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play h-7 w-7 fill-white text-white ml-0.5"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg></span></span></button><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gg9a52-ZbNA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 hover:bg-black/85 transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg>YouTube</a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:grid-rows-3 gap-px bg-white/10"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-auto lg:flex-1 min-h-[72px] bg-gray-950" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(8px)"><img alt="Generated landing example 1" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 280px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-01.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-auto lg:flex-1 min-h-[72px] bg-gray-950" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(8px)"><img alt="Generated landing example 2" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 280px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-02.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-auto lg:flex-1 min-h-[72px] bg-gray-950" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(8px)"><img alt="Generated landing example 3" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-top" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 33vw, 280px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fgallery%2Flanding-03.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Product demo and pipeline tour:<!-- --> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gg9a52-ZbNA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-300/90 hover:text-indigo-200 underline underline-offset-2">Open on YouTube</a></p></div><section class="px-4 py-12"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6"><h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-2">Quality Trust Block</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-4">Live benchmark-based quality metrics from production pipeline.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-sm"><div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-3"><div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Latest</div><div class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold tabular-nums">…</div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-3"><div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">7d rolling</div><div class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold tabular-nums">…</div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-3"><div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Trend</div><div class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold tabular-nums">…</div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-3"><div class="text-gray-500 text-xs">Readiness</div><div class="text-cyan-300 font-semibold tabular-nums">…</div></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Loading metrics…</p></div></section><section class="py-24 px-4" id="features"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16" style="opacity:0"><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4"><span class="text-gradient-primary">Built</span> <span class="text-white">for speed and substance</span></h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Landings are the default guest deliverable; autonomous and admin-queued ideas often become full products — one pipeline, different delivery_profile, identical gates.</p></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">One phrase → presentable page</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your sentence becomes the stakeholder brief through the same stages as autonomous builds — HTML/CSS/JS you preview in the sandbox; gates reject hollow stubs.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Specialized agents</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Specialized roles per stage (Analyst, PM, Methodologist, Architect, Designer/UX, Developer, QA, Security, DevOps, Marketing, Sales, Evolution) — each step bounded so outputs stay maintainable. See `agents/` for the full list.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Quality &amp; security gates</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Demo checks, headless browser smoke, optional marketplace rules — rework loops until the product is show-ready.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-red-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Same runway as autonomous</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Research → spec → architecture → code → QA → security → DevOps → marketing → sales → evolution. Autonomous seeds ideas from the market; on-demand seeds from your phrase — no second-class pipeline.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Director AI</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Meta-agent reviews pipeline health on a schedule and steers autonomous improvements.</p></div></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="glass-card p-6 cursor-pointer h-full" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500 to-amber-500 p-2.5 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coins w-full h-full text-white"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"></circle><path d="M18.09 10.37A6 6 0 1 1 10.34 18"></path><path d="M7 6h1v4"></path><path d="m16.71 13.88.7.71-2.82 2.82"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Crypto-ready storefront</h3><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Affordable one-shot landing price (about $5 USDT when agents omit list pricing), multi-chain checkout — buyers pay on-chain, you ship files.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 px-4" id="pipeline"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16" style="opacity:0"><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">One pipeline, two front doors</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Autonomous mode feeds market research and generated ideas; on-demand uses your phrase as the brief. Same agent path — spec, build, QA, and beyond.</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="absolute top-12 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-fuchsia-500 to-cyan-500 hidden lg:block"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-8 gap-4"><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Research</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-code-xml w-full h-full text-white"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"></path><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Spec</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers w-full h-full text-white"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"></path><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"></path><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Marketing</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500 to-orange-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu w-full h-full text-white"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"></rect><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"></rect><path d="M15 2v2"></path><path d="M15 20v2"></path><path d="M2 15h2"></path><path d="M2 9h2"></path><path d="M20 15h2"></path><path d="M20 9h2"></path><path d="M9 2v2"></path><path d="M9 20v2"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Architect</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette w-full h-full text-white"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Design</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-yellow-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Develop</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">QA</p></div><div class="text-center" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-3 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 p-3 relative z-10 glass-card ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket w-full h-full text-white"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"></path><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path></svg></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 font-medium">Launch</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 max-w-xl mx-auto" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><div class="glass-card cursor-pointer p-6 md:p-8 text-center border border-fuchsia-500/25 bg-gradient-to-b from-fuchsia-500/10 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_48px_-16px_rgba(192,38,211,0.35)]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fuchsia-300/90 mb-2">Product experience</p><div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-500 to-violet-600 p-3 ring-2 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette w-full h-full text-white"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-2">Designer layer — modern UI by default</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Before code ships, the Architect emits a structured `ui_experience` brief: tokens, typography, motion, and a signature visual moment. The Developer treats it as binding for browser deliverables — so landings read as intentional product design, not generic AI gray boxes.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-3 sm:px-4" id="architecture"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto min-w-0"><div class="text-center mb-12" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-indigo-300/90 mb-2">Runtime topology</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Architecture at a glance</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">One control plane: web tier, background workers, routed models, and durable workspace — shown as a live orbit around the agent fleet.</p></div><div class="flex w-full min-w-0 justify-center overflow-hidden pointer-events-none"><div class="relative w-full max-w-[min(100vw-2rem,480px)] aspect-square min-h-0 -translate-x-[50px]"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-[10%] rounded-full opacity-50 blur-3xl bg-[conic-gradient(from_180deg_at_50%_50%,rgba(99,102,241,0.35),rgba(168,85,247,0.25),rgba(34,211,238,0.3),rgba(99,102,241,0.35))]" aria-hidden="true"></div><svg class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full text-white/10" viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="arch-orbit-stroke" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#6366f1"></stop><stop offset="45%" stop-color="#c084fc"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#22d3ee"></stop></linearGradient></defs><circle cx="200" cy="200" r="158" fill="none" stroke="url(#arch-orbit-stroke)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="10 16" opacity="0.55"><animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 200 200" to="360 200 200" dur="96s" repeatCount="indefinite"></animateTransform></circle><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="200" y2="52" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="340.75636441168274" y2="154.26548483250778" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="286.992217339286" y2="319.7345151674922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="113.00778266071399" y2="319.7345151674922" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="59.24363558831729" y2="154.26548483250775" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line><line x1="200" y1="200" x2="199.99999999999997" y2="52" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1"></line></svg><div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 z-10 w-[min(42%,200px)] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"><div class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600/40 via-purple-600/30 to-cyan-600/25 p-6 text-center shadow-[0_0_60px_-12px_rgba(99,102,241,0.55)] backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/10" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.92)"><div class="mx-auto mb-2 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-black/30 ring-1 ring-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot h-7 w-7 text-indigo-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-200/90">Agents</p><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-300/90">PM · Architect · Dev · QA · Sec · Ops · Mkt · Sales · Evolution</p><div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[10px] text-cyan-200/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu h-3