ing-tight text-white">FastAPI</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Public &amp; admin API</p></div></div><div class="absolute z-20 w-[30%] max-w-[9.5rem] min-w-[7rem]" style="left:73.21751746555269%;top:81.95617127781043%;transform:scale(0.85);opacity:0"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-black/55 px-3 py-2.5 text-center shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-workflow mx-auto mb-1 h-5 w-5 text-cyan-300/90" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"></rect></svg><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Pipeline worker</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Quality gates</p></div></div><div class="absolute z-20 w-[30%] max-w-[9.5rem] min-w-[7rem]" style="left:26.782482534447315%;top:81.95617127781043%;transform:scale(0.85);opacity:0"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-black/55 px-3 py-2.5 text-center shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layout-dashboard mx-auto mb-1 h-5 w-5 text-cyan-300/90" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"></rect><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"></rect></svg><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Director AI</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Signals &amp; reports</p></div></div><div class="absolute z-20 w-[30%] max-w-[9.5rem] min-w-[7rem]" style="left:12.433267606341438%;top:37.793828722189566%;transform:scale(0.85);opacity:0"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-black/55 px-3 py-2.5 text-center shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brain mx-auto mb-1 h-5 w-5 text-cyan-300/90" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z"></path><path d="M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z"></path><path d="M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4"></path><path d="M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375"></path><path d="M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5"></path><path d="M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396"></path><path d="M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396"></path><path d="M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516"></path><path d="M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18"></path></svg><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white">LLM router</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Multi-provider</p></div></div><div class="absolute z-20 w-[30%] max-w-[9.5rem] min-w-[7rem]" style="left:49.99999999999999%;top:10.5%;transform:scale(0.85);opacity:0"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-black/55 px-3 py-2.5 text-center shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md ring-1 ring-white/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-database mx-auto mb-1 h-5 w-5 text-cyan-300/90" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"></path><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"></path></svg><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white">Data plane</p><p class="mt-0.5 text-[10px] leading-snug text-gray-500">SQLite · artifacts</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="px-3 py-12 sm:px-4 sm:py-20" id="logos-analytics"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-cyan-300/15 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_80%_30%,rgba(34,211,238,0.13),transparent_38%),radial-gradient(circle_at_20%_80%,rgba(129,140,248,0.12),transparent_42%),rgba(3,7,18,0.72)] p-6 shadow-[0_32px_100px_-48px_rgba(34,211,238,0.42)] ring-1 ring-white/5 backdrop-blur-xl md:grid-cols-[0.92fr_1.08fr] md:p-10 lg:p-14"><div class="relative z-10" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-18px)"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-cyan-300/90">Federation intelligence · live product</p><h2 class="max-w-xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">LOGOS turns the whole ecosystem into one observatory.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-300/85">It polls the Hub, MOMUS, SKOPOS, and Treasury; stores real snapshots; detects rolling z-score anomalies; correlates security, latency, reputation, and economy signals; and answers natural-language questions through a guarded assistant.</p><div class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-300/20 bg-emerald-300/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-200"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(110,231,183,0.9)]"></span>Read-only by construction — never scans, remediates, pays, or deploys</div><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://logos.modelmarket.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-cyan-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-200">Open live LOGOS<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/logos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-white/25 hover:bg-white/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-github h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path></svg>Source</a><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/logos#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-cyan-200 transition hover:text-cyan-100">How the analytics work<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-[30rem]" aria-label="LOGOS read-only federation data topology" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.92)"><div class="absolute inset-[15%] rounded-full bg-cyan-300/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-[8%] animate-[spin_34s_linear_infinite] rounded-full border border-dashed border-cyan-200/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-[22%] animate-[spin_22s_linear_infinite_reverse] rounde